{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32221","headline":"寄湘阴阎少府乞钓轮子 · 温庭筠","name":"寄湘阴阎少府乞钓轮子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钓轮形与月轮同，独茧和烟影似空。\n若向三湘逢雁信，莫辞千里寄渔翁。\n篷声夜滴松江雨，菱叶秋传镜水风。\n终日垂钩还有意，尺书多在锦鳞中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}